### Variáveis de Ambiente
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:3000
@paymentServiceUrl = http://localhost:3004
@orderId = f9a39c50-440b-484a-ad8e-1e1f43e3b068
@userId = 7515bcb1-6d13-413a-b428-4f4e7adffaf3
@bookingUrl = http://localhost:3003

### 1. Teste via API GATEWAY (Porta 3000)
# Se o Gateway estiver funcionando, este deve ser o caminho oficial
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/payment/registerPayment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "method": "PIX",
  "amount": 50.00
}

###

### 2. Teste DIRETO no Microserviço (Porta 3002)
# Use este se o de cima der 404 para testar o microserviço isolado
POST {{paymentServiceUrl}}/registerPayment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "method": "PIX",
  "amount": 50.00
}

###

